docs {
**Check a number now**
Live check of one number: in service, messaging enabled, campaign approved, assigned to the campaign by the messaging provider, delivery failures in the last 24 hours, enablement in progress. Limited to 30 checks per hour per account.

⚠️ Rate-limited (30/hr/account).

OperationId: `messagingHealthCheck`
}
